00:08:38.693 --> 00:08:40.585
And by that, I mean,
if you have a toolkit,

00:08:40.585 --> 00:08:41.521
if you want to be a good carpenter,

00:08:41.521 --> 00:08:43.904
you focus on one tool at a time.

00:08:43.904 --> 00:08:46.308
And similarly, I wouldn't
